item.immersive_aircraft.afterburner_module.description=Jets only: push the stick forward twice quickly for +80% speed for 9 seconds (+80% fuel use while lit).
item.immersive_aircraft.aircraft_finder.description=Use it on an aircraft to bind it, then hold it to find that aircraft. Use it while flying to open the flight menu.
item.immersive_aircraft.airship.description=飛艇可飛的的不快，但駕駛起来很輕鬆。
item.immersive_aircraft.armor_piercing_rounds.description=+30% gun damage, and even more against players and armored mobs.
item.immersive_aircraft.armor_plating.description=+50% durability, -15% engine power, +25% fuel use.
item.immersive_aircraft.autopilot.description=Goes in a weapon slot. Click to engage: climbs to a safe height and flies to your destination.
item.immersive_aircraft.bamboo_hopper.description=一架有三個座位的 chonky 飛機，並有浮躉可安全降落在水面上。
item.immersive_aircraft.biplane.description=雙翼飛機飛行速度快，安全性也很有保障。不過記得，跑道要夠長哦！
item.immersive_aircraft.bomb_bay.description=投下TNT來對地面造成殺傷，不會摧毀方塊
item.immersive_aircraft.bomb_bay_module.description=Twice the bombs from every TNT, dropped twice as fast.
item.immersive_aircraft.cannon_attacker.description=Slow and heavily armored, built around a massive forward cannon.
item.immersive_aircraft.cargo_airship.description=緩慢又耗油，但可以載很多貨物.
item.immersive_aircraft.cluster_bomb.description=Splits into seven small bombs over a wide area. Uses TNT.
item.immersive_aircraft.depth_charge.description=Sinks in water and explodes deep down. Uses TNT.
item.immersive_aircraft.dive_bomber.description=Dives straight down onto its target for pinpoint bombing.
item.immersive_aircraft.extended_range_barrels.description=+50% projectile speed and range.
item.immersive_aircraft.external_cargo_hooks.description=Hook a mob or item hanging below the aircraft from the flight menu. -15% speed while carrying.
item.immersive_aircraft.flanker_jet.description=A big two-seat jet that does it all: dogfights and ground attack.
item.immersive_aircraft.flare_dispenser.description=Drops bright flares that pull heat-seeking missiles away. Uses fire charges.
item.immersive_aircraft.fulcrum_jet.description=An agile jet fighter built for air superiority.
item.immersive_aircraft.guided_bomb.description=Steers toward wherever the gunner who dropped it is looking. Uses TNT.
item.immersive_aircraft.gunner_control_stations.description=Passengers get their own light machine gun (the pilot cannot use them). Uses gunpowder from the cargo.
item.immersive_aircraft.gyrodyne.description=直升機，但是纯人力發動。使勁一推，你就能上天！
item.immersive_aircraft.heat_seeking_missile.description=Locks onto the nearest target ahead. Flares fool it. Fires firework rockets.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_autocannon.description=The heaviest rapid shells. Fires iron nuggets.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_bomb.description=A big bomb with a big blast that breaks blocks. Uses TNT.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_cannon.description=Fires forward. Huge blast, tears through blocks. Fires iron ingots.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_crossbow.description=裝載在飛機上的弩箭型武器，簡單可靠又容易使用
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_fighter.description=A twin-engine fighter with heavy forward guns and a rear gunner.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_machine_gun.description=Slow and punchy. Aims where its gunner looks. Fires gunpowder.
item.immersive_aircraft.heavy_rocket_pod.description=Heavy rockets that break blocks. Fires firework rockets.
item.immersive_aircraft.high_capacity_magazines.description=+50% shots from every ammo item.
item.immersive_aircraft.high_explosive_rounds.description=-15% direct damage, but bullets and shells burst on impact.
item.immersive_aircraft.incendiary_rounds.description=Hits set targets on fire.
item.immersive_aircraft.iron_freighter.description=A three-engine transport for six people and a whole lot of cargo.
item.immersive_aircraft.iron_striker.description=A tough ground-attack plane with an armored cockpit and a rear gunner.
item.immersive_aircraft.item.upgrade=飛機升級
item.immersive_aircraft.item.weapon=飛機裝備
item.immersive_aircraft.jet_bomber.description=A jet-powered bomber that gets in and out before anyone can react.
item.immersive_aircraft.light_autocannon.description=Rapid cannon shells. Fires iron nuggets.
item.immersive_aircraft.light_cannon.description=Fires forward. Small blast, barely scratches blocks. Fires iron ingots.
item.immersive_aircraft.light_machine_gun.description=Fast and light. Aims where its gunner looks. Fires gunpowder.
item.immersive_aircraft.light_rocket_pod.description=Volleys of small rockets. No block damage. Fires firework rockets.
item.immersive_aircraft.lightning_fighter.description=A fast, agile fighter made for dogfights.
item.immersive_aircraft.medium_autocannon.description=Heavier shells, slower fire. Fires iron nuggets.
item.immersive_aircraft.medium_cannon.description=Fires forward. A bigger blast that breaks some blocks. Fires iron ingots.
item.immersive_aircraft.medium_machine_gun.description=Hits harder than the light one, fires a little slower. Fires gunpowder.
item.immersive_aircraft.medium_rocket_pod.description=Bigger rockets, still no block damage. Fires firework rockets.
item.immersive_aircraft.metal_jet.description=A fast twin-jet fighter for chasing down anything in the sky.
item.immersive_aircraft.parachute_system.description=Anyone who leaves the aircraft in the air floats down safely.
item.immersive_aircraft.precision_sights.description=-70% spread.
item.immersive_aircraft.quadrocopter.description=坐在四軸飛行器上建造屬於你的建築奇蹟！
item.immersive_aircraft.radar_guided_missile.description=Locks onto whatever its gunner is looking at. Ignores flares. Fires firework rockets.
item.immersive_aircraft.rapid_reload.description=+30% fire rate for every weapon.
item.immersive_aircraft.reinforced_airframe.description=+25% durability, -30% wind effect, a little slower to accelerate and turn.
item.immersive_aircraft.rotary_cannon.description=使用火藥的輕型機槍，攻擊速度快但傷害不高
item.immersive_aircraft.searchlight.description=Lights up the ground below the aircraft at night.
